{'symbol': 'HPQ', 'date': '2022-03-31 09:00:00', 'title': 'HP AND LEGOR GROUP COLLABORATE TO ADVANCE METALS SCIENCE AND STAINLESS STEEL ACCESSORIES FOR JEWELRY AND FASHION MARKETS', 'text': "PALO ALTO, CALIF. AND VICENZA, ITALY, MARCH 31, 2022 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- HP INC. AND LEGOR GROUP SPA TODAY ANNOUNCED A STRATEGIC COLLABORATION FOR THE DEVELOPMENT OF INNOVATIVE PRECIOUS METAL MATERIALS FOR HP'S METAL JET SYSTEM. LEGOR, A LEADER IN METALS SCIENCE AND PRODUCTION OF BEST-IN-CLASS ALLOYS, POWDERS, AND PLATING SOLUTIONS, IS THE FIRST TO PRODUCE SPECIALTY PRECIOUS METAL MATERIALS FOR THE JEWELRY AND FASHION ACCESSORIES MARKETS DESIGNED TO WORK WITH HP'S REVOLUTIONARY 3D METAL BINDER JET PLATFORM."}